---
The WhatsApp Integration in Taskip enables users to connect their WhatsApp account directly within the platform. It provides a unified messaging dashboard to manage personal and business conversations, collaborate with teams, and streamline client communication.

## Purpose

- Centralize WhatsApp communication
- Manage personal and business chats in one place
- Enable team collaboration on conversations
- Convert chats into leads or contacts
- Improve response efficiency with AI assistance

## Key Features

### Unified Inbox

- Access all WhatsApp messages in one dashboard
- View conversation status: Open, Pending, Closed

### Team Collaboration

- Assign chats to team members
- Add internal notes
- Use tags for organization

### CRM Integration

- Convert chats into Leads
- Convert chats into Contacts
- Link conversations with existing records

### AI Assistance

- Generate conversation summaries
- Draft AI-assisted replies
- Improve response speed and clarity

### Rich Messaging Support

- Text messages
- Images
- Voice notes
- Videos
- Documents
- Audio files
- Emojis

## Supported Accounts

- Personal WhatsApp
- Business WhatsApp

## Activation Flow

### Step 1: Access WhatsApp Module

Navigate to:

- Left Menu → WhatsApp

  ![](./whatsapp-integration/content/image.png)

  \
  **OR**

- Settings → Integrations → WhatsApp

![](./whatsapp-integration/content/image.png)

### Step 2: Activate WhatsApp

Click **Activate WhatsApp Inbox** to start setup.

![](./whatsapp-integration/content/image.png)

### Step 3: Complete Payment

- Pay **$10/month** subscription
- Unlock integration features

![](./whatsapp-integration/content/image.png)

### Step 4: Connect Account

- Scan QR code
- Connect your WhatsApp account

### Step 5: Access Dashboard

After successful connection:

- WhatsApp dashboard becomes available
- Start managing conversations

## Dashboard Features

### Contacts and Status

- View all contacts
- Filter by:
  - Open
  - Pending
  - Closed

### Conversation Management

- Assign chats to team members
- Add tags for categorization
- Add internal notes

### CRM Actions

- Convert chats into Leads
- Convert chats into Contacts

### AI Tools

- Generate conversation summaries
- Create AI-assisted responses

### 6.5 Messaging

Supports:

- Text
- Voice
- Images
- Video
- Documents
- Audio
- Emojis

