{% /table %}

- Flat pricing
- Supports personal and business accounts
- No hidden charges

## System Behavior

- Integration requires active subscription
- QR connection links WhatsApp account
- Conversations sync in real time
- Messages are managed inside Taskip
- AI features assist but do not auto-send messages

## Use Cases

- Manage customer support via WhatsApp
- Handle sales conversations
- Assign chats to team members
- Track and convert leads
- Improve response time using AI

## Best Practices

- Assign conversations to responsible team members
- Use tags to organize chats
- Add notes for internal communication
- Use AI suggestions for faster replies
- Regularly monitor conversation status

## Summary

The WhatsApp Integration in Taskip provides a powerful, centralized communication system that combines messaging, collaboration, and CRM capabilities. It enables teams to manage conversations efficiently, improve response times, and streamline client communication from a single unified dashboard.
